OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies in crash with parked  
OL,4,Alorry                                  
OL,6,FA man in his 70s has died after his car
OL,7,Fcrashed in a parked lorry.             
OL,9,FHampshire Police said the incident on  
OL,10,FBassett Green Road, Southampton, was   
OL,11,Freported at 12:30 GMT on Thursday and  
OL,12,Finvolved a brown Honda Civic and a     
OL,13,Fwhite HGV.                             
OL,15,FThe force said the car driver, from    
OL,16,FSouthampton, died in hospital on       
OL,17,FThursday evening and his family had    
OL,18,Fbeen informed.                         
OL,20,FPolice have appealed for any witnesses 
OL,21,For anyone with information or dash-cam 
OL,22,Ffootage to get in touch.               
